span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Right. Our Unique Selling Point will be creating publicity for their new clothing line and liaising with the media. I am going to finish working on our proposal and will send it to you for a quick review.", "id": 3, "time": "45750"}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about jobs and work. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can ask for and give opinions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can agree politely. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "Have you been in a situation where you had to share your opinion with other people? What was the opinion you shared?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Did other people agree or disagree with you? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " What do you think we should do? ", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " \nJanet and Miranda have a meeting in her office. What are they talking about? \n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"conten